And then we're going to try to log this.pokedex.

07:01.520 --> 07:04.600
And then we're going to log the created lifecycle hook.

07:04.600 --> 07:09.000
So basically, this is basically how you're going to call

07:09.000 --> 07:12.840
the individual lifecycle hooks, is by basically the name right here

07:12.840 --> 07:13.600
that we see here.

